[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7588.149, "timestamp": "02:06:28", "text": "这里隐藏着很多钯金矿藏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7596.149, "timestamp": "02:06:36", "text": "我觉得如果我将来能用钯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7599.669, "timestamp": "02:06:39", "text": "碎片之类的东西制造机器"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7601.669, "timestamp": "02:06:41", "text": "，我就不需要这样肝了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7604.55, "timestamp": "02:06:44", "text": "。 这只是矿石而已。 我需要找到那些"}]